model law10
  tally 1
  on 2026-10-25
  note "Probe LAW-10: a sale's tax pending on spending within a window. Until the window closes the further spending is a hole; each branch is an ask that pins it."
  note "The card says only that it is now 2026; the model's on is a day in 2026 before the window closes, and no figure depends on which."

source card "Probe card LAW-10 (tmp/cases/probes/law/LAW-10.md): story, rule 1 and question"

input gain: money DUK question "What was the gain on the sale?"

input proceeds: money DUK question "What were the proceeds of the sale?"

input rate: num question "At what rate is the gain taxed?"

input sold: date question "On what day was the flat sold?"

input spent_2025: money DUK question "How much of the proceeds did Halina spend on her own home in 2025?"

input spent_more: money DUK question "How much more of the proceeds does Halina spend on her own home by 31 December 2027, besides the 300 000.00 of 2025?"

input window_years: int question "By the end of which year after the year of sale must the proceeds be spent?"

def exempt: num DUK
  note "rule 1: exempt gain = gain x spent / proceeds, at most all of it"
  rule base v card_law = min(gain, gain * (spent_2025 + spent_more) / proceeds)

def tax: num DUK
  note "rule 1: 19 % of the gain that isn't exempt; the card states no rounding"
  rule base v card_law = rate * (gain - exempt)

def window_end: date
  note "rule 1: the end of the third year after the year of sale"
  rule base v card_law = add_days(end_of(year_of(sold) + window_years), -1)

ask settles: window_end

ask tax_pending: tax

ask tax_no_more: tax with spent_more = 0

ask tax_200k_more: tax with spent_more = 200000

version card_law
  cite card
  known 2026-10-25
  note "the card's own rule, a stipulation known from on (L 4.5)"
  rate = 0.19 "rule 1: taxed at 19 %"
  window_years = 3 "rule 1: by the end of the third year after the year of sale"

version card_facts
  cite card
  known 2026-10-25
  note "story: nothing states what else she spends by the end of the window, so spent_more has no row (the gap rule, L 4.6)"
  gain = 100000 "story: a gain of 100 000.00"
  proceeds = 500000 "story: for 500 000.00 DUK"
  sold = 2024-06-01 "story: Halina sells a flat on 1 June 2024"
  spent_2025 = 300000 "story: in 2025 she spends 300 000.00 of it on her own home"
